games.description:
Original table, designed in 2022. This is a RE-SKIN of the jpsalas Table Serious Sam 2.

It is based on the 90's Manga Saint Seiya, also known in Spain at &quot;Caballeros del Zodiaco&quot;
The Knights of the Bronze Constellations must save Princess Athena from the Patriarch by going through the 12 houses of the Zodiac.

Captain Nemo was the first Quetzal Pinball's pinball machine, it's the first pinball to integrate the main screen in the playfield; it also has a subway with a transparent insert that allows the player to see the ball go by.

It is based on the book &quot;20000 Leagues Under the Sea&quot; by Jules Verne, and follows the adventures of Captain nemo with his submarine &quot;Nautilus&quot;

The ramps were designed with stainless steel sheets, and some pinballs were plated with gold or old cooper.

The Robots are waiting to challenge you.
Features:
- Wide open playfield for a long range of shots
- The &quot;Bonus Multiplier&quot; is advanced by hitting 3 &quot;Fixed Targets&quot; and by passing through the &quot;Upper Tunnel&quot;
- The &quot;Orange Special&quot; is increased by hitting 5 &quot;Drop Targets&quot;
- Special is achieved by hitting the &quot;Orange Special Fixed Target&quot;
- Score is increased by hitting the &quot;Time Special Fixed Target&quot;
- 3 &quot;Upper Channels&quot; light the &quot;Ball Return&quot;
- The 2 &quot;Channels&quot; in the lower part of the playfield return the ball to the player
- 3 &quot;Pop&quot; Bumpers increase the play activity
- When the ball passes over &quot;Robot Bridge&quot;, the 5 Robot targets rise
- 5 &quot;Robot Targets&quot; advance &quot;Red Special&quot;

Designed by Norm Clark with art by Christian Marche, Williams' Yukon pinball has a rugged northern wilderness theme, inspired by the Yukon region of Canada. It features 3 reels on Playfield with the famous Mining Camp Reel symbols for high scores and extra balls:
3x coach = 5000 points and 3 extra balls; 3x lanterns or 2x lanterns and 1x coach = 5000 points and 2 extra balls;
3x cooking pans or 2x cooking pans and 1x coach = 4000 points and 1 extra ball; 3x hats or 2x hats and 1x coach = 3000 points;
Any other combination scores 500 points. Scoring 40000 and 80000 points adds an extra ball. 
7 places to score Reel values to add up to reach the Special. The 5 colored bumpers score 10x the bumper value if lit up.
